        "Content": "Entrance Hallway| 2.0m x 6.0m Wood flooring, coving, wall paneling, under stairs storage\r\nSitting Room| 4.0m x 6.0m Wood flooring, feature fireplace with integrated solid fuel stove, double doors to kitchen/dining, coving\r\nKitchen/Dining| 8.1m x 10.8m Wood flooring, breakfast bar island, integrated double oven, hob, extractor hood, microwave & dishwasher, patio doors to garden, open plan design\r\nUtility| 1.5m x 2.0m Tiled floor, built in units\r\nWC| 1.5m x 1.6m Tiled floor\r\n\r\nLanding| 2.6m x 2.9m Carpeted, wall paneling, hotpress, attic with stira\r\nBedroom 1| 2.9m x 4.9m Carpeted, built in sliding wardrobes\r\nEn Suite| 2.1m x 1.5m Tiled floor, tiled shower unit\r\nBedroom 2| 3.1m x 3.5m Carpeted, built in sliding wardrobe\r\nBedroom 3| 2.9m x 3.5m Carpeted, built in sliding wardrobe\r\nBedroom 4| 2.6m x 4.1m Carpeted, built in wardrobe\r\nBathroom| 2.1m x 2.0m Tiled floor, half tiled walls, bath, heated towel rail"
